{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53177","headline":"诗偈 二 · 庞藴","name":"诗偈 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大海濶三千，巨深五六万。\n余特七尺躯，入里饮一顿。\n当时枯竭尽，龙王自出现。\n大阅经藏门，请爲说一徧。\n依如说无法，龙王悟知见。\n卖君髻中珠，隐在如来殿。\n戴将军陈头，贼降不敢战。\n世上有仁人，得永离贫贱。\n不贪有爲身，当见如来面。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庞藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53177.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53177","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}